Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 16:38:01 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] HTDESIGNER-3: code -> designer (CodeLens on C++ / BCB6 event
 handlers, editor right-click) (0.3.0)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- lib/reverse.js: page <title> -> .dfm -> IR events, so
  "TfHotPlate::spbSaveClick" -> Setup.HotPlate.html spbSave.OnClick.
  Pages that share one DFM (main.dfm is split over 9 pages) only get the
  controls they really contain (id="..." in the page).
- CodeLens "設計檢視：<page> › <control>.<event>" above every handler a web
  control uses (port tree and the read-only BCB6 view); click -> opens the
  designer and selects the control. "等 N 個元件" when shared.
- Right-click in a C++ file: the handler the cursor is in, TClass::name under
  it, or a control name (spbSave->...).
- setting ht9045Designer.codeLens (default on).

Tests: lib 56 / probe 2 pages / fake vscode 33 / real VS Code 31 -- all pass,
opened files byte-identical (MD5).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
